WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:10.820
I LOVE YOU, YES. AND I’LL CONFESS
THE THOUGHT OF STAYING IS SO ENTICING.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:11.480
Then stay.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:17.640
AND WHEN YOU SPEAK
MY KNEES GET WEAK

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:22.839
I CAN’T BELIEVE WHAT I’M SACRIFICING.

00:00:22.839 --> 00:00:28.980
BUT LET’S GET REAL
WE KNOW THE DEAL

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:33.300
SO DARLING, LET’S NOT TIPTOE.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:39.580
THIS THING WE HAD
WAS NOT JUST BAD

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:41.240
IT WAS A SHITSHOW.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.040
Greg, come on, it wasn't exactly--

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:46.320
Shh, let me finish.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:49.580
WE CAN’T UNDO.

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:52.520
CAN’T MAKE AMENDS.

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:57.160
DYSFUNCTION IS OUR LINGUA FRANCA.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:09.540
WE CAN’T UNSCREW EACH OTHER’S FRIENDS—
WE’RE JERRY SPRINGER, NOT CASABLANCA.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.840
THERE’S HARD TO GET.

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.960
THEN THERE’S NEGLECT.

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:20.610
TO SAY IT’S FATE, YOU’D HAVE TO BE A BIT
SLOW.

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:25.320
NOT TO BE CRASS
BUT THIS SUCKED ASS

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:28.180
THIS WAS A SHITSHOW.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:33.960
CHERNOBYL NEXT TO US LOOKS LIKE A CAMPFIRE!

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:34.720
Okay, I get it.

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:35.460
I get it.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.400
HURRICANE KATRINA WAS JUST BAD WEATHER!

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:45.940
WE HAVE CHEMISTRY, OF COURSE,
BUT THAT’S A FORMULA FOR DIVORCE

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:55.620
A PLAY ABOUT PIECES OF FECES IS WHAT WE ARE
TOGETHER!

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:56.600
Greg...

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:57.580
OH, WHAT THE HELL.

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:00.520
LET’S GET A HOTEL.

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:06.480
‘CAUSE LIFE IS SHORT AND WE’RE NOT GETTING
ANY YOUNGER.

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:17.400
BUT AFTER SEX, WHAT HAPPENS NEXT
I MEAN IN THE LONG RUN, NOT JUST FATIGUE AND

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.400
HUNGER?

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:29.540
AND WHEN YOU SAY THAT I SHOULD STAY
THAT’S EXACTLY WHEN I SHOULD SPLIT.

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:33.120
THOUGH,
I WON’T FORGET.

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:36.160
I WON’T REGRET—

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:44.020
THIS BEAUTIFUL, HEARTSTOPPING,
BREATHTAKING, LIFECHANGING...

